    "prompt": "Simplify the following.\n$$\\frac{x^2-16}{4x-16}$$",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\dfrac{x+4}{4}$, $x\\in\\mathbb R\\setminus\\{4\\}$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{x^2-16}{4x-16}&=\\frac{(x-4)(x+4)}{4(x-4)}\\\\\\frac{x^2-16}{4x-16}&=\\frac{x+4}{4}\\end{align*}$$\nOriginal domain: $x\\in\\mathbb R\\setminus\\{4\\}$.",
